    "updated_at": "2016-10-12T18:42:03Z",
    "body": "@smaug---- can you describe under what situations Gecko will ignore such form submissions?  We can see [this break](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=653692) in Chrome, even when spoofing a Firefox UA string (and work fine in Firefox, even when spoofing a Chrome UA string).  So we suspect Gecko's behavior doesn't match this spec change, but we haven't yet been able to reduce the issue to a concrete test case, so we might be wrong.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
