    "created_at": "2017-05-25T14:54:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-25T14:54:34Z",
    "body": "> So we suspect Gecko's behavior doesn't match this spec change\r\n\r\nIgnoring for the moment that the spec change doesn't actually change anything because the spec doesn't say what it thinks it says...\r\n\r\nGecko currently fires the submit event before checking connectedness.  The spec is _trying_ to check connectedness before firing the submit event.  Maybe this is the source of the observed behavior difference?  @RByers ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
